{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03743","headline":"军师凯旋自邕州顺流舟中 · 李峤","name":"军师凯旋自邕州顺流舟中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣鞞入嶂口，泛舸历川湄。\n尚想江陵阵，犹疑下濑师。\n岸回帆影疾，风逆鼓声迟。\n萍叶沾兰桨，林花拂桂旗。\n弓鸣苍隼落，劒动白猿悲。\n芳树吟羗管，幽篁入楚词。\n全军多胜策，无战在明时。\n寄谢山东妙，长缨徒自欺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}